WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Zinger, Hazelnut

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.690
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.830
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.730
Episode 19

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.910
Who are you?

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.710
What did you do to Soyeon?

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.390
Let go!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.860
Answer if you want to live.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.360
I didn't do anything.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.930
I just opened my eyes and found myself in the body of this woman.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.600
Where is the real Soyeon?

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:30.840
I don't know.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.610
I don't know if she's alive or dead.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.650
I'll kill you.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:53.330
Benin.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.330
How long have you been in Soyeon's body?

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:33.930
From the day I woke up after falling into the lake.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.810
You said you know everything about me and Soyeon.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.740
All of her memories suddenly came back to me.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.080
There you are.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:10.570
Get up

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:14.040
unless you want to die here.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.620
Hold my hand until we get out of here.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.590
-What are you planning?
-If there are her memories,

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.090
That means Seoyeon is still inside you.

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:34.760
Try to survive.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.330
You must survive.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:49.640
I knew it.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.380
The woman you're in love with...

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.590
Stop it.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.590
I don't want to harm you, get out of our way.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.490
How self-confident!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.670
Take them!

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.540
The Minister of War disobeyed the order!

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:22.980
From now on, I give the orders!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:23.980
-Eat!
-Eat!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.700
Get up, get up.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:44.050
You're bleeding heavily.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.120
We need to stop him.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:02.800
What is this?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.040
This is a list of conspirators.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.780
Protect yourself with it.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.490
Do you remember how we played hide and seek as children?

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.190
I'll count to 10

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.690
and you will hide.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:27.160
Let's go together.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:29.800
He's stalking us.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:39.040
It's pointless.

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:44.180
Go.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.450
And don't look back.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.180
No.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.820
Save Soyeon.

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.060
Live up.

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.640
I count to 10.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:32.460
1, 2, 3...

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.340
5, 6...

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.590
Who sent you?

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.720
Who else?

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.630
Your father.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.480
9, 10.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:58.280
I tried not to look back.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.660
For the queen!

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:35.680
Benin.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.690
Come here. Let's take a walk together.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.860
When I first meet the king, I will pin up my hair.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.630
Can you help me choose a hairpin?

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.400
She doesn't have to be fancy

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.600
I don’t want the regular one either.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.370
Look ahead.

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:18.830
I

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:26.230
always looked at you.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.870
I saw you like this

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:36.910
what you didn't know yourself to be.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:39.880
Why...

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.490
Why me

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:51.220
don't understand?

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:46.080
She didn't go far. Find her!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.170
Where did she go?

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.470
Search everywhere!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.640
-Eat!
-Eat!

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:02.220
Over there!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.550
What should I do alone with this thing?

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:07.220
I don't even know where I am.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.590
What can I do?

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.900
I couldn't do anything when people were dying before my eyes!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.460
Nothing!

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:27.070
This is the end.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.480
No matter how hard I try,

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.810
some things are not meant to happen.

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:52.530
OK. Take me away.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.670
It's all over anyway.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.870
The man who rose from the dead

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:37.480
Queen.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.150
You're alive.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:42.780
I'm glad.

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.350
I'm very happy.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.170
Everything will be fine.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.470
You're alive, everything will be fine.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.740
That's all I need.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:13.080
Everyone died.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.150
Lady Choi,

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.950
Hong Young and Kim Byungin.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:22.120
Everyone died.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.790
Kim Byungin is dead?

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.630
He died because of me.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.800
Everyone died because of me.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:35.800
Calm down.

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:38.200
My queen, calm down.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.610
Hong Young and Lady Choi

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.140
alive.

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:51.220
Your Majesty!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.020
Hong Young!

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:00.660
Your Majesty.

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:02.360
Are you okay?

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.530
I'm fine. Where is Lady Choi?

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.130
Your Majesty!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.470
Court lady Choi.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.240
-Oh no. Lady Choi.
-Your Majesty.

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:18.110
As expected, it is dangerous outside the palace.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.580
It probably hurts.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.580
It hurts like crazy.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.150
How so.

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:26.190
God.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.950
Don't worry

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.590
it means I won't die.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.260
With a mortal wound, I would not feel pain.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.060
But he swung his sword.

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:39.330
Let's say I'm lucky.

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:41.130
Back!

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:48.170
He didn't wield a sword well, and that also saved him.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:57.620
I really thought something happened to you!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:00.750
Your Majesty.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.220
Your Majesty.

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.530
Sorry. I didn't want to.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.630
-Everything is fine?
-Yes.

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:08.890
I'm sorry.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:13.670
Where have you been, Your Majesty?

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.200
I searched the whole forest.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.640
But I couldn't find it.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:21.340
A lot of people were looking for you.

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:25.310
But the king found you.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.460
-Your Majesty.
-We missed you.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:47.900
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:50.140
God.

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:51.970
God.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.020
Needs to be washed.

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:16.900
You're pregnant.

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.030
Why did you go into the forest?

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:22.000
You didn't come back for a long time.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.300
I followed you.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:27.010
You always surprise me.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:28.940
There was no choice.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.680
Without you in the palace

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:37.620
it was like an eclipse.

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.890
Everywhere I went there was darkness.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:44.860
Come on

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:46.860
I’ll explain what an eclipse is.

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:49.530
No need to explain. I know everything.

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:53.330
I felt the same way.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.070
I missed you.

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.840
The pain in my soul was stronger

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:03.540
body pain from wounds.

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:13.420
I won't leave you alone again.

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:18.160
Sorry.

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:16.050
-Are you seriously injured?
-I'm fine.

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:19.990
With the medications I'll be as good as new.

00:23:40.040 --> 00:23:42.240
Did you find out who attacked you?

00:23:42.910 --> 00:23:44.980
I saw a familiar face.

00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:01.260
Donghak followers!

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:20.780
I saw the king.

00:24:29.390 --> 00:24:36.530
The king is alive.

00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:40.040
The king is alive.

00:24:42.670 --> 00:24:43.770
Stop.

00:24:44.310 --> 00:24:46.180
A state of emergency has been declared.

00:24:46.180 --> 00:24:48.110
How dare a woman walk around alone?

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:55.820
Cho's rejected concubine.

00:24:56.220 --> 00:24:58.420
I'm ashamed to appear in public

00:24:58.420 --> 00:25:01.660
I wanted to get some fresh air while no one was there.

00:25:01.760 --> 00:25:04.230
It's dangerous on the streets now. Go back.

00:25:04.560 --> 00:25:06.930
I understood. Thank you.

00:25:18.110 --> 00:25:20.380
The greedy Kim clan tried to kill the king

00:25:20.380 --> 00:25:22.380
and frame the innocent.

00:25:23.180 --> 00:25:25.180
Fate decided to leave the king alive.

00:25:25.480 --> 00:25:28.950
Is it possible to occupy a throne that is already occupied?

00:25:28.950 --> 00:25:31.220
The king is alive.

00:25:41.030 --> 00:25:43.270
Mister!

00:25:44.600 --> 00:25:47.240
It was on the streets, sir.

00:25:47.400 --> 00:25:50.070
What is there to make so much noise?

00:25:55.640 --> 00:25:56.710
God.

00:26:00.580 --> 00:26:02.520
The king is alive.

00:26:06.190 --> 00:26:07.790
If so, then the queen

00:26:09.290 --> 00:26:11.160
I didn’t leave to recover.

00:26:15.330 --> 00:26:16.870
So,

00:26:17.300 --> 00:26:20.440
Kim Jwageun saw right through Kim Byongin.

00:26:20.440 --> 00:26:23.010
I can’t believe that he foresaw Benin’s betrayal.

00:26:24.340 --> 00:26:28.040
The gentleman wants us to remain silent about the death of Benin.

00:26:28.840 --> 00:26:30.680
-Yes, father.
-However,

00:26:31.110 --> 00:26:34.450
We have now established relations with Jvagyn.

00:26:36.720 --> 00:26:38.490
But they missed the queen.

00:26:39.790 --> 00:26:41.790
We have to try

00:26:42.930 --> 00:26:44.530
make amends, right?

00:26:54.370 --> 00:26:57.470
That's it! If you boil it so much, it will completely soften.

00:26:57.740 --> 00:26:58.970
Leave him alone.

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:01.880
After the queen left to recuperate,

00:27:01.880 --> 00:27:03.410
he lost his mind.

00:27:04.150 --> 00:27:06.110
They say that hatred makes you more deeply attached than love.

00:27:07.020 --> 00:27:10.090
I think he became very attached to her while she was here.

00:27:21.400 --> 00:27:24.270
I can't believe the king died in vain.

00:27:26.070 --> 00:27:29.300
He truly cared about his people.

00:27:35.080 --> 00:27:38.880
As expected, you are alone here.

00:27:42.550 --> 00:27:47.560
Yes, no one is waiting for me at home.

00:27:49.290 --> 00:27:53.260
Is Her Majesty also very depressed?

00:27:54.030 --> 00:27:57.130
I don’t even know what to tell you, court lady Choi.

00:27:57.330 --> 00:27:59.000
Your very existence

00:28:00.140 --> 00:28:02.770
has already comforted and reassured me.

00:28:03.770 --> 00:28:06.980
I even forgot about the complaints for a while.

00:28:07.080 --> 00:28:10.450
I feel the same thanks to you.

00:28:14.880 --> 00:28:16.490
Do you want to eat?

00:28:16.490 --> 00:28:17.790
No, thanks.

00:28:18.350 --> 00:28:20.090
I'm a little busy.

00:28:20.520 --> 00:28:24.290
Just a minute. I have something to give you.

00:28:29.430 --> 00:28:30.800
I like you.

00:28:35.570 --> 00:28:36.940
I love you.

00:28:37.940 --> 00:28:39.540
I'm not in a position to express

00:28:40.280 --> 00:28:43.280
these feelings so

00:28:43.510 --> 00:28:45.650
you should

00:28:46.820 --> 00:28:49.250
meet a good woman

00:28:50.090 --> 00:28:52.120
to brighten up your loneliness.

00:28:56.160 --> 00:28:57.560
Court lady Choi.

00:29:08.870 --> 00:29:10.970
I felt that something was wrong.

00:29:11.970 --> 00:29:13.640
How's the cooking going?

00:29:14.210 --> 00:29:16.180
Oh no!

00:29:16.780 --> 00:29:18.350
Royal Chef!

00:29:18.710 --> 00:29:20.720
Oh, I ruined everything.

00:29:20.750 --> 00:29:23.750
It's a rare sight to see a royal chef spoil food.

00:29:24.120 --> 00:29:25.250
What happened to you?

00:29:25.250 --> 00:29:27.690
Nothing wrong with me. Something happened to the country.

00:29:27.790 --> 00:29:29.930
Panic gripped the south of the country.

00:29:30.190 --> 00:29:32.660
So in the last days there are no gifts.

00:29:32.890 --> 00:29:34.260
Royal chef.

00:29:35.760 --> 00:29:38.100
I heard that strange proclamations were posted on the streets of the city.

00:29:39.400 --> 00:29:40.940
Those who attacked the king...

00:29:40.940 --> 00:29:44.340
If not the followers of Tonhak, who else would do such a thing?

00:29:44.340 --> 00:29:47.810
They all need to be executed. Catch and kill!

00:29:47.880 --> 00:29:52.680
Kill? Do you even know how to do this?

00:29:53.580 --> 00:29:54.750
So shut your mouth.

00:29:55.680 --> 00:29:56.820
Tell me about it.

00:30:07.530 --> 00:30:11.700
I've worn it too long. I started to get tired.

00:30:12.630 --> 00:30:14.770
I think it's time to take it off.

00:30:16.840 --> 00:30:19.370
Can you handle it? You worked with me for 10 years.

00:30:20.410 --> 00:30:21.440
What?

00:30:25.710 --> 00:30:26.880
Where are you going?

00:30:26.950 --> 00:30:29.580
Who will cook?

00:30:30.090 --> 00:30:32.890
There are many in Joseon who can be royal chefs.

00:30:34.990 --> 00:30:36.190
What's happening?

00:30:41.430 --> 00:30:44.630
In recent days, strange appeals have appeared on the streets of the city.

00:30:45.570 --> 00:30:48.040
They say we are talking about rumors about the king.

00:30:48.740 --> 00:30:50.110
Here's how.

00:30:50.310 --> 00:30:52.540
Are rumors important now?

00:30:52.870 --> 00:30:55.910
It will all be over after the coronation.

00:30:56.950 --> 00:30:59.080
What should we worry about now?

00:30:59.080 --> 00:31:01.550
so this is the letter on which our lives depend.

00:31:01.850 --> 00:31:05.820
It's suspicious that Kim Byungin is nowhere to be seen these days.

00:31:07.020 --> 00:31:09.960
The Queen left to prepare for the birth.

00:31:10.230 --> 00:31:11.790
And Kim Byungin is missing too?

00:31:12.160 --> 00:31:16.570
Death of the King and Departure of the Queen.

00:31:16.600 --> 00:31:18.370
Everything is somehow suspicious.

00:31:20.340 --> 00:31:23.740
What if both are lies?

00:31:24.070 --> 00:31:26.240
He hid the queen

00:31:26.580 --> 00:31:28.340
who considers the king's death imaginary,

00:31:28.340 --> 00:31:31.080
and took her side?

00:31:31.080 --> 00:31:33.350
Then Kim Byongin signed the letter,

00:31:34.220 --> 00:31:38.720
to destroy the Kim clan.

00:31:44.390 --> 00:31:45.930
Cold.

00:31:47.060 --> 00:31:48.160
Cold?

00:31:54.400 --> 00:31:57.010
How awkward.

00:31:59.810 --> 00:32:00.910
Wait a minute.

00:32:10.190 --> 00:32:13.360
As soon as you left, it suddenly got colder.

00:32:15.620 --> 00:32:18.690
Are you cold because I wasn't around?

00:32:23.800 --> 00:32:26.740
Thank you for your boundless love.

00:32:27.340 --> 00:32:30.270
2, 3, 1, 1, 2, 3,

00:32:30.270 --> 00:32:31.810
2, 1, 2, 3,

00:32:31.810 --> 00:32:34.710
- 4, 1, 2, 3, 4.
-Continue.

00:32:35.410 --> 00:32:36.510
This is...

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:39.680
The training you talked about.

00:32:40.380 --> 00:32:42.320
So that's why you wrote a textbook on military tactics.

00:32:42.580 --> 00:32:45.390
I can't believe that the king is a follower of donghak.

00:32:48.120 --> 00:32:49.930
I even hid it from them.

00:32:50.860 --> 00:32:54.030
Like a merchant, dissatisfied with the country that helps him.

00:32:55.030 --> 00:32:56.900
Why are you doing such dangerous things?

00:32:57.200 --> 00:32:59.330
They say the enemy of your enemy is your friend.

00:33:00.040 --> 00:33:03.340
Corrupt officials are our common enemy.

00:33:05.040 --> 00:33:07.340
Isn't the scope too small?

00:33:07.780 --> 00:33:08.880
Where is everyone?

00:33:08.880 --> 00:33:10.580
Do you want us to get together and kill us all at once?

00:33:10.910 --> 00:33:13.780
Everyone will come together at the right time.

00:33:13.980 --> 00:33:16.550
In the meantime, it's safer to be apart!

00:33:17.790 --> 00:33:19.390
Are you in charge here?

00:33:19.390 --> 00:33:20.490
Yes, I am.

00:33:20.520 --> 00:33:22.590
1, 2, 3. Four.

00:33:22.590 --> 00:33:24.760
1, 2, 3. Five.

00:33:24.760 --> 00:33:26.660
1, 2, 3. Six.

00:33:26.660 --> 00:33:28.700
1, 2, 3. Seven.

00:33:29.300 --> 00:33:30.330
-1, 2, 3. Eight.
-Nice to meet you.

00:33:30.800 --> 00:33:33.000
It's clear from your face that you're in charge.

00:33:33.130 --> 00:33:35.670
The scar on the eye is especially impressive.

00:33:36.300 --> 00:33:37.410
Nice to meet you.

00:33:38.470 --> 00:33:41.380
The main thing here is the one who lives longer.

00:33:41.380 --> 00:33:43.980
As soon as one dies, the next one becomes the main one.

00:33:44.350 --> 00:33:47.550
To be in charge means to survive the longest.

00:33:48.250 --> 00:33:51.950
If I die, he will become the boss here.

00:33:51.950 --> 00:33:54.360
Nine. 1, 2, 3. Ten.

00:33:54.490 --> 00:33:55.820
This baby?

00:33:56.420 --> 00:33:58.430
I heard you are close with my Damhyang.

00:33:59.290 --> 00:34:00.460
My Damhyang?

00:34:01.500 --> 00:34:02.860
So you...

00:34:02.860 --> 00:34:05.900
He is Damhyang's father, whom we were looking for.

00:34:06.970 --> 00:34:09.300
The one whose eye was damaged with a pitchfork?

00:34:10.240 --> 00:34:11.610
It's a small world!

00:34:12.410 --> 00:34:15.710
If it weren't for Damhyang, I would have already killed this guy.

00:34:15.710 --> 00:34:17.580
I'll meet the damn king
who brought the country to this point,

00:34:17.580 --> 00:34:20.350
I'll cut his throat right away. That's what I thought.

00:34:21.120 --> 00:34:22.850
Thanks to your daughter.

00:34:22.850 --> 00:34:26.320
You could have died trying to kill me.

00:34:27.060 --> 00:34:28.120
What?

00:34:30.330 --> 00:34:31.630
I didn't need to save you.

00:34:31.630 --> 00:34:34.460
You just had to finish it off with a straw knife.

00:34:34.460 --> 00:34:35.660
3. Ten.

00:34:36.330 --> 00:34:38.170
How many more times do we have to repeat this?

00:34:38.630 --> 00:34:40.900
You have to feel it for yourself!

00:34:41.270 --> 00:34:43.200
Should I say this every time?

00:34:45.770 --> 00:34:49.210
Damhyang saved you. And she also saved me.

00:34:49.540 --> 00:34:51.750
The king does not abandon his people.

00:34:52.580 --> 00:34:54.250
Therefore, the people save the king.

00:34:55.580 --> 00:34:58.350
By the way, what happened to the warriors who were chasing me?

00:34:59.420 --> 00:35:01.790
Many were born and raised here.

00:35:01.790 --> 00:35:03.660
They are hunters and gatherers of herbs.

00:35:03.660 --> 00:35:05.460
They know the mountains like the back of their hand.

00:35:05.460 --> 00:35:08.330
The guards can't reach them here.

00:35:08.630 --> 00:35:10.700
What about the weird guy in the tokkaebi mask?

00:35:10.900 --> 00:35:11.930
Did you grab it?

00:35:12.030 --> 00:35:13.100
-Wearing a tokkebi mask?
- 1, 2,

00:35:13.100 --> 00:35:15.770
3. 1, 2...

00:35:15.770 --> 00:35:17.170
Was he chasing you too?

00:35:17.170 --> 00:35:18.670
He tried to kill me.

00:35:20.680 --> 00:35:21.840
Kim Byungin died

00:35:23.910 --> 00:35:25.280
trying to stop him.

00:35:26.480 --> 00:35:27.980
Masked Man

00:35:28.950 --> 00:35:30.590
serves Kim Jwageun.

00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:34.990
Kim Jwageun is back.

00:35:36.320 --> 00:35:37.390
1, 2, 3. Seven.

00:35:37.390 --> 00:35:40.060
1, 2, 3. Eight.

00:35:40.060 --> 00:35:41.900
1, 2, 3. Nine.

00:35:41.900 --> 00:35:43.770
1, 2, 3. Ten.

00:35:45.270 --> 00:35:46.500
Straight out from Death Note.

00:35:46.700 --> 00:35:48.170
Here are the names of all the officials,

00:35:48.170 --> 00:35:49.540
which need to be removed.

00:35:51.810 --> 00:35:54.380
All that remains is to find a way to return to the palace.

00:35:55.040 --> 00:35:56.180
If you gather everyone,

00:35:56.180 --> 00:35:58.310
who is on our side, how many can we recruit?

00:35:58.780 --> 00:36:00.980
If collected from all over the country,

00:36:00.980 --> 00:36:02.880
then about 1000 people.

00:36:03.180 --> 00:36:05.450
-That's all?
-That's a lot.

00:36:06.020 --> 00:36:07.790
Risking your life is not easy.

00:36:08.490 --> 00:36:10.190
Then why didn't they kill the governors?

00:36:10.360 --> 00:36:12.060
Get rid of them and you will win the war.

00:36:12.060 --> 00:36:14.630
Do you think we are some kind of bloodthirsty hyenas?

00:36:15.160 --> 00:36:17.570
Even low-born people like us

00:36:17.570 --> 00:36:20.300
united, they can instill fear in the rulers.

00:36:20.970 --> 00:36:22.300
This was our intention.

00:36:23.410 --> 00:36:25.810
It's clear. So you wanted to attract attention?

00:36:26.370 --> 00:36:27.880
This is a good strategy.

00:36:27.880 --> 00:36:30.450
You didn't give them a reason to start fighting against you.

00:36:30.880 --> 00:36:32.550
Maybe we're stupid

00:36:32.550 --> 00:36:35.680
but we knew that if we came face to face, we would lose.

00:36:36.620 --> 00:36:39.390
They gathered 1000 warriors.

00:36:42.820 --> 00:36:45.060
I risked my life for the sake of the country!

00:36:45.060 --> 00:36:47.200
Do you think I'm up to something?

00:36:47.500 --> 00:36:49.630
-Royal chef?
-Incredible.

00:36:50.230 --> 00:36:51.370
Royal chef?

00:36:51.930 --> 00:36:53.940
How can we trust the man from the palace?

00:36:55.140 --> 00:36:56.700
Well, of course.

00:36:56.970 --> 00:36:59.610
Fine. I'll come back. Untie me.

00:37:02.310 --> 00:37:04.780
OK. I'll untie it myself.

00:37:04.780 --> 00:37:06.550
Why are you looking so angry?

00:37:06.920 --> 00:37:10.120
You are definitely younger than me. Where are your manners?

00:37:10.350 --> 00:37:11.820
If you beg, I won’t stay!

00:37:12.750 --> 00:37:13.760
Out of the way!

00:37:15.660 --> 00:37:17.490
You came of your own accord,

00:37:17.490 --> 00:37:19.190
but you won’t be able to leave like that.

00:37:20.560 --> 00:37:23.000
Some familiar situation.

00:37:23.000 --> 00:37:24.670
You've seen all our faces.

00:37:24.670 --> 00:37:26.330
And they even found out about this place.

00:37:26.940 --> 00:37:28.370
Do you think you can leave alive?

00:37:29.070 --> 00:37:30.070
What?

00:37:30.740 --> 00:37:31.810
There you go.

00:37:32.340 --> 00:37:34.340
Damn it. No need.

00:37:34.610 --> 00:37:35.840
Royal chef.

00:37:37.150 --> 00:37:40.720
It seems my time has come. You'll hear something like this.

00:37:41.380 --> 00:37:42.780
Manbok.

00:37:48.260 --> 00:37:50.560
Your Majesty! Why are you...

00:37:52.160 --> 00:37:53.700
Your Majesty!

00:37:57.970 --> 00:37:59.070
Royal Chef!

00:37:59.870 --> 00:38:01.800
Court Lady Choi!

00:38:10.980 --> 00:38:12.750
Court lady Choi.

00:38:12.750 --> 00:38:15.150
-Royal cook.
-Court Lady Choi.

00:38:15.850 --> 00:38:17.320
What's happened?

00:38:18.120 --> 00:38:20.120
Who did it?

00:38:20.120 --> 00:38:21.760
What is this?

00:38:22.920 --> 00:38:25.690
-Royal cook.
-I knew that you would save me.

00:38:31.900 --> 00:38:33.940
What brought you here?

00:38:34.200 --> 00:38:35.540
Your Majesty.

00:38:36.340 --> 00:38:39.210
I heard that everyone who was unhappy in this country came here.

00:38:39.210 --> 00:38:40.780
So I went myself.

00:38:40.780 --> 00:38:44.110
And the people who disappeared from the palace are also here.

00:38:45.350 --> 00:38:48.750
Royal Chef, were you unhappy in this country?

00:38:49.050 --> 00:38:50.920
Watching what's going on in the palace,

00:38:50.920 --> 00:38:53.450
even I, the happiest of all, became unhappy.

00:38:53.660 --> 00:38:55.390
What's going on in the palace?

00:38:55.390 --> 00:38:57.260
About this, Your Majesty.

00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:02.160
Change your clothes first.

00:39:02.160 --> 00:39:04.930
And cover yourself when you sneeze.

00:39:16.680 --> 00:39:18.810
Tomorrow is the coronation ceremony.

00:39:18.810 --> 00:39:20.880
Every second counts.

00:39:21.220 --> 00:39:22.680
You did a good job.

00:39:22.680 --> 00:39:24.890
By the way, why are the followers of donghak

00:39:24.890 --> 00:39:27.620
Are they resisting more and more, because we have reined them in?

00:39:28.420 --> 00:39:31.330
Bad news is reaching me.

00:39:31.330 --> 00:39:34.130
The point is, the more your opponent retreats,

00:39:34.130 --> 00:39:37.300
the more you justify yourself and act more violently.

00:39:37.300 --> 00:39:41.740
Therefore, the only solution is to teach them a tougher lesson.

00:39:42.170 --> 00:39:43.300
After the ceremony

00:39:43.300 --> 00:39:45.310
I'll use the guns to take back control.

00:39:47.610 --> 00:39:49.480
I haven't seen you with a sword for a long time.

00:39:50.040 --> 00:39:52.150
Is the palace no longer safe?

00:39:52.280 --> 00:39:54.680
This is a gift from the Queen.

00:39:55.480 --> 00:39:57.890
-Queens?
-In fact,

00:39:59.150 --> 00:40:01.960
I'm afraid I have bad news for you.

00:40:02.820 --> 00:40:04.460
Benin sacrificed himself

00:40:04.460 --> 00:40:06.230
to save the queen.

00:40:06.660 --> 00:40:08.000
That's how it is.

00:40:10.770 --> 00:40:14.170
The only drawback of youth is stupidity:

00:40:14.170 --> 00:40:16.400
sacrifice everything for fleeting feelings.

00:40:18.210 --> 00:40:21.780
So the queen survived?

00:40:23.010 --> 00:40:24.050
Yes.

00:40:26.110 --> 00:40:28.380
The queen was saved by the king.

00:40:29.520 --> 00:40:32.620
So, does that mean they're both alive?

00:40:34.590 --> 00:40:35.920
This makes you think:

00:40:35.920 --> 00:40:38.290
there is no one to rely on, or are they that smart?

00:40:38.660 --> 00:40:41.500
I'm sorry. Therefore...

00:40:46.700 --> 00:40:49.470
That time we tried

00:40:49.470 --> 00:40:51.670
give the queen arsenic,

00:40:53.040 --> 00:40:55.310
the king found out about this and came running.

00:41:04.220 --> 00:41:05.350
I think

00:41:08.090 --> 00:41:12.090
there was a rat who had been listening all this time.

00:41:20.870 --> 00:41:23.670
It was you who gave it to me as a gift.

00:41:23.940 --> 00:41:26.340
You personally blinded and stunned her.

00:41:26.340 --> 00:41:27.940
I'm overly sensitive

00:41:27.940 --> 00:41:29.580
apparently because of the upcoming ceremony.

00:41:34.620 --> 00:41:36.580
I understand everything.

00:41:36.850 --> 00:41:38.950
We will hold the ceremony as soon as possible.

00:41:40.720 --> 00:41:45.330
Don't forget that those two already defeated you once.

00:41:46.360 --> 00:41:47.930
I'll bet my life

00:41:49.060 --> 00:41:50.770
for this fight.

00:41:57.770 --> 00:41:59.070
I have an idea.

00:41:59.610 --> 00:42:02.480
We will be able to pass the gates at Hanyang and the palace.

00:42:04.450 --> 00:42:06.780
So what did you come up with?

00:42:06.780 --> 00:42:09.780
These people are accustomed to eating fresh food.

00:42:09.780 --> 00:42:12.050
How long will they last without fresh food?

00:42:12.820 --> 00:42:15.290
The Queen Dowager is extremely picky.

00:42:15.960 --> 00:42:17.190
She won't last long.

00:42:25.400 --> 00:42:26.600
Not this.

00:42:28.200 --> 00:42:29.200
That.

00:42:30.070 --> 00:42:31.110
That.

00:42:35.510 --> 00:42:36.610
Therefore

00:42:37.610 --> 00:42:40.820
this door will not be closed under any circumstances.

00:42:42.320 --> 00:42:44.020
Products are delivered through it.

00:42:50.190 --> 00:42:53.390
We need to find out about the royal offering cart.

00:42:53.830 --> 00:42:56.700
The palace has a whole system for royal offerings.

00:42:56.700 --> 00:43:01.370
More than 50 such carts come to the royal kitchen every day.

00:43:01.370 --> 00:43:04.410
Moreover, there are special monthly offerings.

00:43:04.410 --> 00:43:07.280
And there are also offerings that come every 4 months.

00:43:08.710 --> 00:43:11.480
-Simpler. Straight to the point.
-Fine.

00:43:11.880 --> 00:43:13.980
62 carts will arrive at the palace

00:43:13.980 --> 00:43:16.050
on the morning of the ceremony.

00:43:16.050 --> 00:43:18.320
But a state of emergency has been declared.

00:43:18.690 --> 00:43:22.560
I am sure that the royal offerings will be checked with special attention.

00:43:22.560 --> 00:43:26.330
But what if there is a cart that no one knows about?

00:43:28.330 --> 00:43:29.630
Inspector's carriage.

00:43:32.370 --> 00:43:34.270
Well, you're finally here.

00:43:34.270 --> 00:43:37.770
This cart is ours. Skip them.

00:43:38.570 --> 00:43:39.740
-Fine. Come on in.
-Yes.

00:43:39.740 --> 00:43:40.980
Chief Inspector

00:43:40.980 --> 00:43:42.680
usually swaps carts.

00:43:43.080 --> 00:43:44.250
Swaps?

00:43:44.250 --> 00:43:46.510
Well, not all officials are picky.

00:43:46.510 --> 00:43:48.450
He changes some of the offerings

00:43:48.450 --> 00:43:50.420
for slightly lower quality products.

00:43:50.420 --> 00:43:52.420
And in the inspector's cart lie

00:43:52.420 --> 00:43:54.920
products for which he exchanges offerings.

00:43:55.290 --> 00:43:57.960
And only a handful of people know about it.

00:43:57.960 --> 00:43:59.860
I knew it.

00:43:59.860 --> 00:44:02.460
This is not a palace, but a den of thieves.

00:44:03.460 --> 00:44:04.830
I'm sorry.

00:44:04.830 --> 00:44:06.430
I thought it was necessary.

00:44:08.100 --> 00:44:11.140
Rotten wood has holes.

00:44:13.070 --> 00:44:14.840
And we can use them.

00:44:16.440 --> 00:44:18.110
So, let's all hold out our hands.

00:44:18.480 --> 00:44:19.780
-Let's.
-All?

00:44:19.780 --> 00:44:20.980
Hands here. Forward.

00:44:20.980 --> 00:44:22.650
-Here.
-God.

00:44:22.650 --> 00:44:23.720
1, 2, 3.

00:44:23.720 --> 00:44:24.920
Go ahead!

00:44:25.090 --> 00:44:26.350
-Forward!
-Forward!

00:44:26.850 --> 00:44:27.920
Forward.

00:44:39.730 --> 00:44:42.440
-Ready?
-Yes, let's go.

00:44:46.340 --> 00:44:48.410
-Manbok.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:44:48.810 --> 00:44:49.880
Faster.

00:44:53.310 --> 00:44:55.020
-And he has changed.
-Let's go.

00:45:44.100 --> 00:45:45.270
Thank you

00:45:47.900 --> 00:45:49.270
and forgive me.

00:45:52.470 --> 00:45:55.210
You were special to Kim Soyeon too.

00:46:10.960 --> 00:46:12.530
I want to bury him myself.

00:46:15.160 --> 00:46:16.300
Fine.

00:46:33.380 --> 00:46:34.950
Rest in peace.

00:46:40.820 --> 00:46:41.920
Shall we go?

00:47:01.540 --> 00:47:02.880
Speak.

00:47:05.780 --> 00:47:08.180
The Queen must prepare for the birth of her baby

00:47:08.180 --> 00:47:10.620
with mother

00:47:11.790 --> 00:47:16.390
but since this is impossible, I would like to help her myself.

00:47:17.660 --> 00:47:20.800
Came to ask where she was.

00:47:20.800 --> 00:47:22.960
The Queen bears an heir, so

00:47:22.960 --> 00:47:25.330
I can’t tell you its location.

00:47:25.330 --> 00:47:26.930
I provided her with everything she needed,

00:47:26.930 --> 00:47:28.540
so don't worry.

00:47:33.940 --> 00:47:35.110
Here.

00:47:51.160 --> 00:47:52.930
The king is not dead

00:47:52.930 --> 00:47:56.560
Is she really getting ready to give birth?

00:47:56.800 --> 00:48:00.370
You didn't harm her, did you?

00:48:01.870 --> 00:48:04.110
The queen has escaped.

00:48:04.540 --> 00:48:07.370
We defend her honor.

00:48:09.610 --> 00:48:11.310
-Run away?
-She believes

00:48:11.310 --> 00:48:14.010
that the king is alive, she even left the palace.

00:48:15.880 --> 00:48:17.250
I'm sorry,

00:48:18.020 --> 00:48:21.260
but I will tell you openly, Your Majesty.

00:48:22.190 --> 00:48:26.460
Your behavior doesn't help our family,

00:48:26.460 --> 00:48:29.430
but on the contrary, it tarnishes her name.

00:48:29.930 --> 00:48:31.200
Don't you understand

00:48:31.200 --> 00:48:33.470
what will our future generation say about us?

00:48:33.970 --> 00:48:37.570
Are you in a position to talk like that?

00:48:39.540 --> 00:48:42.910
At least I have a feeling of shame.

00:48:42.910 --> 00:48:45.750
Your shame is your crime.

00:48:45.750 --> 00:48:47.980
If there is no shame, there is no crime.

00:48:47.980 --> 00:48:49.780
If not for the sake of family honor,

00:48:50.580 --> 00:48:53.490
then why did you come so far?

00:48:53.490 --> 00:48:54.890
Even the king was harmed.

00:48:57.790 --> 00:48:59.860
My time won't end

00:49:00.530 --> 00:49:03.830
until I want it myself.

00:49:43.800 --> 00:49:45.070
You hear everything.

00:49:56.020 --> 00:49:59.050
-There.
-Teho.

00:50:01.060 --> 00:50:02.120
Your Majesty.

00:50:02.720 --> 00:50:03.960
They got there before us.

00:50:04.190 --> 00:50:05.490
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:50:05.490 --> 00:50:07.390
God, my knees hurt so much.

00:50:07.600 --> 00:50:08.630
Your Majesty.

00:50:09.930 --> 00:50:10.970
Hello.

00:50:13.500 --> 00:50:16.140
Glad you're alive.
You've been through a lot.

00:50:16.440 --> 00:50:18.270
We're glad you're safe.

00:50:19.670 --> 00:50:21.240
Who has cigarettes?

00:50:21.280 --> 00:50:23.380
Your Majesty, it's cold here.

00:50:29.220 --> 00:50:32.550
I wouldn't mind a cold can of beer right now.

00:50:35.390 --> 00:50:37.190
It's not so great here

00:50:37.190 --> 00:50:38.530
so why did we come?

00:50:38.530 --> 00:50:41.930
It's safest here
no one knows about this place.

00:50:42.560 --> 00:50:45.700
How's that? Even if you want it, you won't find it.

00:50:46.330 --> 00:50:47.700
God, my legs.

00:50:55.680 --> 00:50:56.780
Crap.

00:50:58.550 --> 00:50:59.650
It's not time yet.

00:50:59.650 --> 00:51:01.080
How long is it possible?

00:51:01.080 --> 00:51:03.880
This is the last chance. You need to be careful.

00:51:12.690 --> 00:51:13.960
It's already time.

00:51:25.870 --> 00:51:27.110
So delicious?

00:51:38.120 --> 00:51:40.290
-Here.
-Here.

00:51:59.970 --> 00:52:01.310
God.

00:52:22.150 --> 00:52:23.420
Very tasty.

00:52:39.540 --> 00:52:41.540
Looking for trouble?

00:52:42.740 --> 00:52:45.680
People like me will still die

00:52:45.680 --> 00:52:47.180
We have no choice.

00:52:47.340 --> 00:52:50.310
And you have the highest position in all of Joseon.

00:52:50.310 --> 00:52:53.880
If we closed our eyes to everything, wouldn’t we live in abundance?

00:52:54.720 --> 00:52:56.890
There was a time when I

00:52:57.590 --> 00:52:59.960
lived in a nightmare that I had to endure.

00:53:01.290 --> 00:53:03.530
I endured everything only with the thought of taking revenge on those

00:53:04.800 --> 00:53:07.830
who killed my parents, brothers and sisters.

00:53:08.900 --> 00:53:12.100
Then began to see the rotting of Joseon

00:53:12.770 --> 00:53:15.440
and people who suffered.

00:53:18.240 --> 00:53:20.340
And you have a keen eye.

00:53:20.580 --> 00:53:22.950
I thought that everyone in the palace was blind.

00:53:25.420 --> 00:53:27.150
If everything works out,

00:53:27.990 --> 00:53:31.290
You won't become like them, will you?

00:53:35.130 --> 00:53:36.430
I

00:53:38.000 --> 00:53:40.630
I dream of a new Joseon.

00:53:43.670 --> 00:53:46.070
You called it "elections"?

00:53:47.070 --> 00:53:48.070
What?

00:53:48.070 --> 00:53:50.470
When people choose their king.

00:53:50.710 --> 00:53:52.080
Yes. Elections.

00:53:52.580 --> 00:53:54.950
But this does not mean that the world will become ideal.

00:54:02.450 --> 00:54:05.220
Well, that's already good.

00:54:05.760 --> 00:54:08.230
You can change it if something goes wrong.

00:54:09.530 --> 00:54:12.930
Both the king and the queen are both madmen.

00:54:13.560 --> 00:54:16.930
Well, go to bed early, we have a big deal ahead of us.

00:54:20.870 --> 00:54:21.970
Good night.

00:54:26.880 --> 00:54:29.110
If you really are from the future,

00:54:29.850 --> 00:54:32.020
it means you know how it will all end.

00:54:33.950 --> 00:54:35.190
What will happen?

00:54:40.390 --> 00:54:41.590
You will lose.

00:54:45.700 --> 00:54:47.730
But I'll bet everything on you.

00:54:49.230 --> 00:54:52.400
Aren't you always on the winning side?

00:54:53.070 --> 00:54:54.300
Nothing.

00:54:54.300 --> 00:54:56.170
I've already screwed up in this life.

00:54:56.810 --> 00:54:58.940
Even if I put everything on the line, it’s okay.

00:55:00.880 --> 00:55:03.410
So you put all your eggs in my basket?

00:55:04.310 --> 00:55:07.180
Yes. All. I went all in.

00:55:10.990 --> 00:55:13.960
Even if I fail, I will do my best.

00:55:15.260 --> 00:55:17.730
Until fate gets tired of me,

00:55:18.400 --> 00:55:20.730
I won’t let her eat me up so easily.

00:55:41.050 --> 00:55:42.690
I can't believe it

00:55:43.290 --> 00:55:45.520
that I'm stuck here and can't help the king.

00:55:46.320 --> 00:55:48.190
Do you think the queen met him?

00:55:48.190 --> 00:55:52.100
Even if they met, what can they do on their own?

00:55:53.900 --> 00:55:55.900
I don't think there is

00:55:55.900 --> 00:55:57.900
way to stop the coronation.

00:56:02.840 --> 00:56:04.210
And if you use Kim Hwan...

00:56:09.110 --> 00:56:10.250
Hon.

00:56:16.790 --> 00:56:17.990
Have you come again?

00:56:18.420 --> 00:56:19.920
Brought something.

00:56:23.060 --> 00:56:24.190
What is this?

00:56:28.000 --> 00:56:29.670
I'm collecting requests

00:56:29.670 --> 00:56:31.230
to free you.

00:56:32.600 --> 00:56:36.040
But is there anything else I can do to help?

00:56:38.140 --> 00:56:39.310
Help?

00:56:39.310 --> 00:56:41.650
Yes. Ask for anything.

00:56:42.410 --> 00:56:44.250
-All?
-Yes.

00:56:44.850 --> 00:56:47.920
I'll do anything for you.

00:56:53.590 --> 00:56:54.730
Why

00:56:56.390 --> 00:56:58.560
do you trust people that much?

00:57:00.600 --> 00:57:02.700
Is your job to feed scammers?

00:57:02.870 --> 00:57:05.040
How are you going to survive in this cruel world?

00:57:06.070 --> 00:57:08.040
Sorry, I was wrong.

00:57:09.410 --> 00:57:12.240
-What is wrong?
-I don’t know what exactly,

00:57:13.210 --> 00:57:15.550
but since you say so, I won’t do it anymore.

00:57:15.550 --> 00:57:16.910
You're wrong about that

00:57:18.880 --> 00:57:20.580
that you trust people like me.

00:57:24.550 --> 00:57:27.160
I tried to be friends with you
to find out information.

00:57:28.190 --> 00:57:29.430
And you had no idea.

00:57:33.200 --> 00:57:34.660
What's all this for?

00:57:40.500 --> 00:57:41.540
That is

00:57:44.310 --> 00:57:46.880
all this time you didn't consider me a friend?

00:57:47.340 --> 00:57:48.380
No.

00:57:49.410 --> 00:57:50.810
I didn't count you

00:57:52.180 --> 00:57:53.680
your friend not for a second.

00:57:56.820 --> 00:57:58.420
So don't you dare come back.

00:58:34.590 --> 00:58:36.590
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:58:37.090 --> 00:58:39.160
Blame it on

00:58:39.530 --> 00:58:41.360
can't we use it anymore?

00:58:43.100 --> 00:58:44.600
I didn't look at you.

00:58:46.100 --> 00:58:49.170
Now before my eyes
such a dishonor has happened.

00:58:59.120 --> 00:59:00.880
You must be very tired.

00:59:08.360 --> 00:59:09.960
I don't dilute with water.

00:59:10.860 --> 00:59:12.200
I mix it with soju.

00:59:14.000 --> 00:59:15.930
Golden ratio, somek.

00:59:22.370 --> 00:59:24.470
You seem to be dreaming about something good.

00:59:27.540 --> 00:59:28.750
What a relief.

00:59:51.430 --> 00:59:53.170
What did you dream about?

00:59:53.370 --> 00:59:55.910
The king's portrait was blazing.

00:59:56.540 --> 01:00:00.710
The fire consumed all of Seongwonjong.

01:00:01.240 --> 01:00:05.180
And I'm stuck here alone when the fire...

01:00:22.230 --> 01:00:23.970
Today is a significant day.

01:00:23.970 --> 01:00:25.540
Not a drop can be spilled.

01:00:53.630 --> 01:00:55.830
Powder me so that I don't have a single blemish.

01:01:05.410 --> 01:01:09.610
Day of the accession ceremony

01:01:21.830 --> 01:01:23.360
For Your Majesty's safety

01:01:23.360 --> 01:01:26.300
I ordered a curfew in the palace.

01:01:26.730 --> 01:01:30.100
Everyone except the warriors
must remain inside the palace.

01:01:31.200 --> 01:01:32.240
Yes.

01:01:32.240 --> 01:01:35.010
I didn't invite the royal family, nor did I invite the musicians.

01:01:35.840 --> 01:01:37.770
Let the ceremony proceed peacefully.

01:01:37.770 --> 01:01:39.180
Even the royal family?

01:01:39.180 --> 01:01:40.880
It will be safer this way.

01:01:40.880 --> 01:01:41.910
But...

01:01:51.290 --> 01:01:53.360
Everything I say is correct.

01:01:56.660 --> 01:01:57.890
I understand.

01:02:06.070 --> 01:02:08.570
Your Majesty, aren't you scared?

01:02:09.070 --> 01:02:10.210
Don't worry.

01:02:10.210 --> 01:02:12.780
The believers I sometimes met on the street

01:02:12.780 --> 01:02:15.010
they said that my ancestors would give me a blessing.

01:02:15.580 --> 01:02:17.110
So I'll use it now.

01:02:18.520 --> 01:02:19.580
Your Majesty,

01:02:20.250 --> 01:02:24.390
today more than any other day,
you look like the queen I know.

01:02:28.490 --> 01:02:30.130
There is no need for such a mood.

01:02:30.130 --> 01:02:32.800
It's like the last day.
And this is just the beginning.

01:02:33.530 --> 01:02:35.030
You are right, Your Majesty.

01:02:45.010 --> 01:02:46.810
Meet us at the palace at night.

01:02:47.840 --> 01:02:50.410
Certainly. It's time to go.

01:02:54.320 --> 01:02:55.520
Don't die.

01:02:55.520 --> 01:02:57.490
What's so good in life?

01:02:57.490 --> 01:03:01.160
Even if our life is miserable
and it’s a pity, let’s live longer.

01:03:03.490 --> 01:03:04.960
If everything works out now,

01:03:04.960 --> 01:03:08.500
I'll "vote" for you, or whatever it is,
in place of the king.

01:03:10.800 --> 01:03:11.900
Thank you.

01:03:16.110 --> 01:03:17.240
Well, shall we go?

01:03:17.970 --> 01:03:19.580
It's time to go home.

01:03:21.480 --> 01:03:22.980
Criminal Lee Kyung-eun

01:03:22.980 --> 01:03:25.550
hid the identities of the traitors, the followers of donghak.

01:03:25.820 --> 01:03:26.920
He will be stripped of his position

01:03:26.920 --> 01:03:28.620
and sent into exile.

01:03:29.250 --> 01:03:30.890
Criminal Hong Duil

01:03:30.890 --> 01:03:32.720
lost a firearm.

01:03:32.720 --> 01:03:34.220
He will work in the office

01:03:34.220 --> 01:03:36.630
Ganghwa within 600 days
like a state slave.

01:03:39.300 --> 01:03:40.860
After the ascension ceremony

01:03:40.860 --> 01:03:42.600
I will carry out the sentence immediately.

01:03:50.170 --> 01:03:53.180
There were no achievements to
attribute something to the current king.

01:03:53.180 --> 01:03:55.280
It wasn't easy for us.

01:03:59.350 --> 01:04:01.020
The king's funeral service is not over yet.

01:04:01.020 --> 01:04:03.450
Is it appropriate to smile to your teeth?

01:04:05.690 --> 01:04:06.990
I'm sorry.

01:04:09.230 --> 01:04:12.100
How will the ceremony go, will there be any problems -

01:04:12.530 --> 01:04:14.160
it's all up to you.

01:04:14.630 --> 01:04:17.630
Yes! I will definitely do my duty

01:04:17.630 --> 01:04:20.070
so that the absence of the Minister of War
didn't affect anything.

01:04:20.340 --> 01:04:22.710
By the way,

01:04:23.370 --> 01:04:28.040
When will Kim Byungin return to the palace?

01:04:29.580 --> 01:04:32.320
I suppose you want to know the fate of the letter.

01:04:33.350 --> 01:04:35.320
Everyone is worried about it.

01:04:35.320 --> 01:04:38.020
Don't worry. I'll take care of everything.

01:04:38.290 --> 01:04:40.660
Yes, yes.

01:04:42.190 --> 01:04:44.590
Now the king and the Phunyang family of Cho

01:04:46.200 --> 01:04:48.130
will be my puppets.

01:05:05.450 --> 01:05:07.480
Sir, I pay double for the palace.

01:05:09.250 --> 01:05:10.350
Doubly.

01:05:24.930 --> 01:05:27.600
Hey, we're good people.

01:05:28.970 --> 01:05:32.010
But if the Chief Inspector or anyone
he still sees something suspicious,

01:05:33.240 --> 01:05:35.750
we can actually become bad.

01:05:37.080 --> 01:05:39.220
I don't care
whether human nature is good or not.

01:05:39.220 --> 01:05:41.620
It all depends on what they do.

01:05:43.390 --> 01:05:45.390
Be more natural, more natural.

01:05:45.490 --> 01:05:46.590
Let's.

01:06:02.970 --> 01:06:04.170
Let's go.

01:06:17.720 --> 01:06:20.490
It's uncomfortable, move a little.

01:06:22.660 --> 01:06:23.730
Like this?

01:06:24.060 --> 01:06:25.460
Is this an elbow?

01:06:25.730 --> 01:06:27.030
Hare poke at me.

01:06:27.560 --> 01:06:30.000
If you put pressure on my stomach like that...

01:06:30.700 --> 01:06:32.370
That's it.

01:06:37.710 --> 01:06:38.740
Move over.

01:06:41.810 --> 01:06:43.010
Oh you.

01:06:45.050 --> 01:06:46.480
Finally I see something.

01:06:54.520 --> 01:06:55.760
Right here...

01:07:00.400 --> 01:07:01.500
There is no time for this.

01:07:02.170 --> 01:07:04.300
You're right, you need to pull yourself together.

01:07:05.170 --> 01:07:07.440
It's good that I didn't hide here
with some guard.

01:07:08.240 --> 01:07:09.610
Why are you talking about this?

01:07:09.710 --> 01:07:13.810
Move a little, I’ll change my position.

01:07:18.450 --> 01:07:19.580
Mommies.

01:07:27.720 --> 01:07:30.660
Now I'm comfortable.

01:07:32.260 --> 01:07:34.960
I agree, this pose is the best.

01:07:45.170 --> 01:07:47.140
We will be caught because of the roar of your heart.

01:07:47.440 --> 01:07:48.950
Why are you so scared?

01:07:50.180 --> 01:07:52.010
It's not just my heart.

01:08:02.430 --> 01:08:05.030
And not only because of fear.

01:08:07.030 --> 01:08:08.870
It's also because of you, my queen.

01:08:14.070 --> 01:08:17.510
For me, it’s not out of fear either.

01:08:43.530 --> 01:08:45.370
It's from England.

01:08:45.370 --> 01:08:47.100
Much more powerful and faster.

01:08:51.440 --> 01:08:54.340
If the king appears in the palace,

01:08:55.410 --> 01:08:57.510
aim for his heart.

01:09:19.470 --> 01:09:20.840
New, or what?

01:09:22.000 --> 01:09:23.540
Yes.

01:09:25.140 --> 01:09:26.510
Come on in.

01:09:46.200 --> 01:09:47.530
Stop.

01:09:58.610 --> 01:09:59.880
-Search.
-Yes!

01:10:16.690 --> 01:10:18.130
Nothing suspicious.

01:10:49.030 --> 01:10:53.300
How I became queen

01:11:13.320 --> 01:11:17.190
As soon as the ceremony is over,
I will finish them all off.

01:11:17.190 --> 01:11:20.260
Same feeling as before
the appearance of the main boss in the games.

01:11:20.260 --> 01:11:21.890
I'm good with knives.

01:11:22.730 --> 01:11:25.430
I'm crazy.
From words about a special task

01:11:25.490 --> 01:11:26.800
My heart began to boil.

01:11:26.800 --> 01:11:29.900
The changes you feared have already begun.

01:11:29.900 --> 01:11:32.170
What the hell are you doing?

01:11:32.200 --> 01:11:34.040
Is the king on the same side as the donghak followers?

01:11:34.040 --> 01:11:36.810
I am a relative of those you killed.

01:11:36.810 --> 01:11:41.510
I am the king of those people whom you have neglected!
